{"id":"9df3c26c280af75a","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-atomic-formula.md","title":"Atomic Formula","display":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-atomic-formula","aliases":["88-df-atomic-formula"],"display":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula","depends_on":["[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-symbol]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-atomic-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-atomic-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atomic-formula — Atomic Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1, \\ldots, t_n \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t_1, \\ldots, t_n \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (terms, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-ary relation-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0f1e525f3e037509\" href=\"?note=0f1e525f3e037509\" title=\"88-df-symbol\">88-df-symbol</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> (atomic-formula set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\coloneqq\n\\left(\n\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\n\\{R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\}\n\\right)\n\\cup\n\\{t_1=t_2:t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\coloneqq\n\\left(\n\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\n\\{R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\}\n\\right)\n\\cup\n\\{t_1=t_2:t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-原子公式集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(t_1, \\ldots, t_n)\">\\(P(t_1, \\ldots, t_n)\\)</span> : 原子公式（不含逻辑联结词或量词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1 = t_2\">\\(t_1 = t_2\\)</span> : 等式（也是原子公式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>原子公式是一阶逻辑公式的&quot;原子&quot;构成单位：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原子公式表达最基本的命题</li>\n<li>所有复杂公式都由原子公式通过联结词和量词构造</li>\n<li>原子公式的真值由结构和赋值直接决定</li>\n</ul>\n<p>例子：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x = y\">\\(x = y\\)</span>（等式）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(x) = y\">\\(S(x) = y\\)</span>（后继等于）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x + y = z\">\\(x + y = z\\)</span>（加法等于）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(x)\">\\(P(x)\\)</span>（属性）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>非原子公式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(x) \\land Q(y)\">\\(P(x) \\land Q(y)\\)</span>（含联结词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x P(x)\">\\(\\forall x P(x)\\)</span>（含量词）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>：原子公式由项构成</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>：由原子公式构造的复合公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>：不含自由变量的公式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-symbol]]","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t_1, \\ldots, t_n \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S$ (terms, see [[./88-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-symbol","status":"resolved","id":"0f1e525f3e037509","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n$ ($n$-ary relation-symbol set, see [[88-df-symbol]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$P(t_1, \\ldots, t_n)$ : 原子公式（不含逻辑联结词或量词, see [[88-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$t_1 = t_2$ : 等式（也是原子公式, see [[88-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]：原子公式由项构成","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]：由原子公式构造的复合公式","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"13ac48daafe6d04f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-sentence]]：不含自由变量的公式","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t_1, \\ldots, t_n \\in \\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atomic\\text{-}formula} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\coloneqq\n\\left(\n\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\n\\{R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\}\n\\right)\n\\cup\n\\{t_1=t_2:t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"P(t_1, \\ldots, t_n)","display":false},{"tex":"t_1 = t_2","display":false},{"tex":"x = y","display":false},{"tex":"S(x) = y","display":false},{"tex":"x + y = z","display":false},{"tex":"P(x)","display":false},{"tex":"P(x) \\land Q(y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x P(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1582,"backlinks":[{"id":"ae0e85fc0e149930","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ (atomic-formula set, see [[88-df-atomic-formula]])"},{"id":"12768269414f5f5d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml